    2511: Text { content: "This is a listing of skills that an IHC should have as a minimum.  How the Proficiency Checks are conducted is up to the local unit.  The intent is for the Superintendent and Reviewing Official to verify the crew being reviewed is proficient in these skill areas.  This is a crew proficiency check, all items do not necessarily apply to all crewmembers" }
